    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of health interoperability standards, Our company's platform, Atelier supports HL7/FHIR through Our company's platform, Atelier health interoperability framework alignment with Ségur/Mon espace santé–DMP, and our have a delivery partner, Ligeo Santé, that helps with this integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty, our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only. the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only ensures that data is hosted exclusively within EU and meets the client's requirements for data sovereignty. our can propose an architecture where Our company's platform, Atelier is deployed on the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, with standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH/DPI integration. our API-first approach (REST + webhook) with documented APIs will enable easy embedding in existing work environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our support for SAML, OIDC, LDAP, and Entra ID user directories ensures secure identity management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier model-agnostic nature allows our to choose the most suitable model options that meet the client's requirements. our can opt for the Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which provides fully sovereign, auditable, and strong grounding/citation behavior." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our current technical stack can meet the client's requirements, and our can propose a robust architecture to ensure seamless integration with existing systems while maintaining data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict GDPR compliance, encryption, pseudonymisation of sensitive data, and adherence to French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures can we implement to guarantee the protection of personal and health data, and ensure we solution meets all regulatory requirements? we can implement several security controls and measures to guarantee the protection of personal and health data and meet regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, is already certified with ISO 27001 since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of Our company, Faber IA solutions, including those related to healthcare." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address GDPR compliance, Our company, Faber IA can ensure that our solution adheres to the principles of data protection by design and default, as required by Article 25 of GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
