    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirement to improve efficiency and quality of care, and considering our company's past experience in healthcare projects, what project management methodologies can our company's propose to ensure successful delivery of the AI assistance solution within the estimated global budget of 900,000 over 5 years? our company's can propose a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement has been successfully used in our company's past healthcare projects, such as the pilot assistant for medical documentation integrated with a regional hospital group's electronic patient record.  a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement will include Two-week sprints with demonstrable increments, ensuring continuous progress and adaptation to changing requirements. a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement will comprise five phases: Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run, each ending with a formal review and a go/no-go decision. a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement is adapted from standard public-sector project frameworks, with documented deliverables at each gate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By using this methodology, our company's can ensure that the AI assistance solution is delivered within the estimated global budget of 900,000 over 5 years, while improving efficiency and quality of care for the client. our company's past experience in managing similar projects, combined with our company's understanding of the client's requirements and constraints, will enable our company's to successfully deliver the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an intelligent assistance tool that provides response times below 2 seconds for common queries, integrates with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), supports health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR), and ensures data sovereignty by hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture can our propose to ensure seamless integration? our platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that provides a median latency of 1.3 seconds for common queries, with a p95 latency below 2 seconds. a median latency of 1.3 seconds for common queries, with a p95 latency below 2 seconds meets the client's requirement for response times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier also has standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH/DPI integration, which can facilitate seamless integration with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

